rd.</li>\n<li>Drone (UAS) operations under Part 107—mapping, thermal imaging, live data feeds.</li>\n<li>Manned aircraft conducting search support, targeted supply deliveries, and overhead damage assessment.</li>\n<li>Serve as lead among Air Care Alliance aviation NGOs, while building enduring partnerships with new aviation NGOs.</li>\n</ul>","donationFundsHtml","<p>Donations enable IRG&#39;s Aviation Section to maintain mission-ready aerial response capabilities, including equipment readiness and coordination systems that allow aviation assets to be effectively leveraged in a rapid response situation to support vetted partners and government agencies.</p>",{"_57":329,"_324":330,"_326":315},{"_57":327,"_324":328,"_326":317},{"_57":323,"_324":325,"_326":319},"what-your-donation-funds","heading","What your donation funds","html","how-we-do-it","How we do it","what-we-do","What we do"]
